Z||000000||Haze_Performance||06-13-2000||09:00 PM||||I went to the GM car show at Village Pontiac last weekend and won my first Fiero trophy. There were 5 Fieros there (A Silver GT with a Northstar and a body kit "1st place"....Paul Vargyas's V8 Formula "2nd place"...Me 85 2M4 stock 40,000 miles "3rd Place...A great looking red V8 Formula "Friend of Paul's"...and a 84 White 2m4 with T-Tops..I'm very hyped up about the car now.I almost didnt enter. I parked across the lot from them "The other Fieros" and thought that there was no way I could compete with them..But my girlfriend talked me into entering so I rushed across the street to a Mobil car wash "THANK YOU MOBIL" and ran it through. I came back and parked next to the other cars just in time ..<p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 06-13-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000001||tgowens||06-13-2000||10:12 PM||||Good job Haze!!! You deserve it!! it is really nice when the "daily drivers" get noticed, right?||||reg||1
Z||000002||wkayl||06-13-2000||11:20 PM||||I know just how you feel.  I drove 1,557 miles round trip from Loveland CO (see Fiero Fire in this topic) to Sisseton SD to a show last weekend and took 1st place in the "76 and newer 2 door special interest" class.  It is kinda nice to stand there and explain what a Fiero is to other car people.  Funny thing was that some said they had never seen one before so I told them to turn around.  There was a guy there with an 87 GT (mine is an 86GT) on the other side of the street.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||06-14-2000||02:24 AM||||Haze, Good job! I was suppose to go but couldn't make it. See even the stock daily drivers can win! Hey I thought there was suppose to be 2 classes Modified and Stock?<BR>Did they combine the 2 because of the low number of Fiero's there? You should have won First in stock since the other 2 above you should have been in the Modified class.||||reg||14
Z||000004||Haze_Performance||06-14-2000||03:13 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>Haze, Good job! I was suppose to go but couldn't make it. See even the stock daily drivers can win! Hey I thought there was suppose to be 2 classes Modified and Stock?<BR>Did they combine the 2 because of the low number of Fiero's there? You should have won First in stock since the other 2 above you should have been in the Modified class.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There was only 1 class for Fiero's on the sheet. Thats why I thought I didnt stand a chance.<BR>||||reg||14
Z||000005||Fret Naught||06-14-2000||12:45 PM||||Way to go HAZE, I bet that feels real good!!, I think I would have been too nervous to enter, just goes to show you, you can't win if you don't even enter eh!!||||reg||1
